title: "Arbiter Arena: a deterministic evaluation harness for tool-using LLM agents"
abstract: >-
  An SRD 5.1-compatible tactical combat engine and a deterministic evaluation
  harness for tool-using LLM agents, with a pre-registered study of how an
  agent's action interface affects its reliability, cost and tactics.
type: software
